    "observations": [
      "Part1 starts black; later sampled opening frames show the SH-201 panel and keyboard, with several illuminated bank/number indicators. No complete initial patch recipe is displayed.",
      "Part2 first50s shows a changing patch: DESTINATION1 knob orientation differs at0/5/10s, LFO shape indicator position differs by20s, an oscillator-section knob is manipulated at30s, FILTER ENV sliders at49s. RATE looks unchanged across sparse samples, which is not proof it never moves or that both LFOs have a known raw rate.",
      "Part2 portamento chapter291\u2013320s contains bank/number button operations, keys, filter cutoff manipulation at306s and FILTER ENV manipulation at319s. The chapter is not one fixed patch.",
      "Front panel is oblique and oscillator/left-side labels are soft. Hands sometimes hide pressed keys and controls. No raw parameter values, precise complete note performance, single-oscillator isolation, effects-off state or exact preset identity recovered.",
      "Independent mapping against official Owner Manual p40: at4s selected SHAPE LED is second from the clockwise end (S&H); at20s it is at the clockwise end (random). LFO1 button appears selected at4s. Confidence moderate-high for shape position, moderate for LFO selection; raw rate and routing remain unverified."
    ],
